  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Centro de Formacin y Capacitacin para Mujeres K&apos;inal Antsetik, A.C. (CEFOCAM), a women-led indigenous organization, will offer training in cooperativism, leadership and the rights of women, including those who identify as LBTI, in indigenous communities in the highlands of Chiapas, Oaxaca and Guerrero. Benefits will reach 372 indigenous women and 1,500 members of their families.</narrative>
  </description>
